 Government Services: Our focus is on asset Predictive Maintenance, Autonomous Operations, Space Solutions and Intelligent Estate Management. We are also implementing machine learning and artificial intelligence to enhance our digital solutions of the GS sector by predicting and diagnosing issues before equipment, device or facility is failed or completely utilized. 
